{"user": "ok i get it. after b6 then what would you do", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T12:37:48.837451+00:00", "assistant": "After **b6**, White gets a turn, so I wouldn\u2019t lock in the next move yet.\n\nMy plan would be:\n\n- **If b7 is still available for Black**, I\u2019d strongly look there next \u2014 it can take that row without giving White the **a8 corner** immediately.\n- If White plays near the corner, pause and ask: \u201cDoes my move give White **a8**?\u201d Avoid that unless you\u2019ve counted it out.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T12:38:05.506619+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T12:38:07.271970+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Conversational Acknowledgment", "Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Conversational Acknowledgment", "Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Conversational Acknowledgment": 3, "Common Ground Question": 2, "Solution Request": 2}, "confidence": {"Conversational Acknowledgment": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.6666666666666666, "Solution Request": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Conversational Acknowledgment", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Conversational Acknowledgment", "Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Conversational Acknowledgment", "Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 2, "Prompt": 2, "Provide Correct Answer": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "Provide Correct Answer": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "sonnet": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Prompt"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": fa