{"user": "if i put b6 does the only thing that changes is the white on a6?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:34.493766+00:00", "assistant": "No \u2014 **a6 would not flip** after **b6**, because it\u2019s not bracketed by another black disc on the left edge.\n\nIf Black plays **b6**, the flips are along the diagonal:\n\n- **c5**\n- **d4**\n- **e3**\n\nSo b6 flips **3 white discs**, not a6.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:42.921757+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:43.823744+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3, "Think Aloud": 1}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0, "Think Aloud": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Negative Feedback": 3, "Provide Correct Answer": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Negative Feedback": 1.0, "Provide Correct Answer": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback"], "llama": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Negative Feedback"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Negative Feedback"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 1, "Negative Feedback": 2, "Move Verdict": 1, "Board Report": 2}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 0.3333333333333333, "Negat